data: {"id": "82051a7ebf574266-thinking-parallel_evidence-992", "run_id": "82051a7ebf574266", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n**实体身份**\n- Pod：`workload`，命名空间 `aiops-case-v08`，UID `00e5e755-886e-4661-9e8a-00d1e71595f6`，调度在 `node2`。\n\n**支持\"CrashLoopBackOff 且根因为容器启动失败”的事实**\n- Pod 状态与容器状态：\n  - `phase: Running`，但 `Ready: False`、`ContainersReady: False`，消息为 `containers with unready status: [app]`。\n  - 容器 `app`：`ready=False`，`restarts=8`，`reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`exitCode=127`，并提示 `back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app`。\n  - 这些指标一致表明容器反复退出并被 kubelet 退避重启，符合 CrashLoopBackOff 行为。\n- 事件（Events）：\n  - 持续出现 `Warn", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789132846791, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

